# Squad Rallier: "{2}{W}: Look at the top four cards of your library. You may reveal a creature card with power 2 or less from among
# them and put it into your hand. Put the rest on the bottom of your library in a random order." Of the top four (Serra Angel 4/4,
# Hill Giant 3/3, Grizzly Bears 2/2, Memnite 1/1) Bears and Memnite qualify (power exactly 2 and below it) but only
# one may be taken, and the Giant is one over the power limit and the Angel two over. The Savannah Lions (2/1) beneath them is not among the four and stays where it was. Black Lotus'
# three mana pay {2}{W} exactly, and the Rallier does not tap for its own ability.

